<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42353" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sălīvōsus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Full of spittle</i>, <i>slavering</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">labia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Mag. p. 313</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aegrotans,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
					Aur. Acut. 2, 2 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Slimy</i>, <i>clammy</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">umor (corticis ulmorum),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					16, 38, 72, § 181</span></i>
			.</div>
